  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yanbeilong\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Yanbeilong\">Yanbeilong ultimus</a></i> showing known fossil material of the holotype specimen (<b>SXMG V 00006</b>). Scale bar=1 m.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(SXMG V 00006)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#B7AEAB\" title=\"#B7AEAB\"> </b>=Mirrored elements from the right side<br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080%2F08912963.2024.2308214\">\"A new stegosaur from the late Early Cretaceous of Zuoyun, Shanxi Province, China\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016%2Fj.cretres.2024.105852\">\"The first stegosaurian dinosaur from Gansu Province, China\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr-_IeihcFY\">\"The secrets of <i>Yanbeilong ultimus</i> | Why was its species name given \"the Last\"?\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/sketchy-raptor/art/Say-some-Stegosaurus-stenops-skeletons-sir-884386195\">Stegosaurus stenops skeletals</a> by Matt Dempsey</li></ul>",
